diff --git a/CHANGELOG.rst b/CHANGELOG.rst
index e166f03..d945374 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.rst
+++ b/CHANGELOG.rst
@@ -1,3 +1,11 @@
+Unreleased
+==========
+
+- Rename the ``time`` parameter of ``TTLCache.expire()`` and
+  ``TLRUCache.expire()`` to ``now``.  The ``time`` keyword argument is
+  deprecated, but still accepted for now.
+
+
 v7.2.8 (2026-10-31)
 ===================
 
